      "content": "hey so i think i got a UTI again... it's really burning when i go. i have some macrobid (nitrofurantoin) left over from a few months ago, is it okay if i just take some of that to clear it up? i've been struggling with my kidneys lately (they told me i have stage 3 CKD) so i just wanted to check if that's safe to do.",
